# BuildKit prefers `<dockerfile-path>.dockerignore` over the context root's
# `.dockerignore`, which is the only way to scope this build: the context is
# the PARENT directory (it has to be — the admin UI takes ui-components as a
# `file:` dependency), and that parent holds ~30 unrelated sibling repos and
# ~15GB. Without this file every one of them is uploaded to the daemon on
# every build.
#
# Shape: deny everything, re-admit the two directories the build reads.

*

!event-catalog

# --- event-catalog -----------------------------------------------------------
# Sources, lockfiles and contracts/ only. node_modules and the two dist trees
# are rebuilt inside the image; copying the host's would drag darwin-arm64
# esbuild/rollup binaries into a linux image and let `npm install` decide they
# were already satisfied.
event-catalog/node_modules
event-catalog/dist
event-catalog/coverage
event-catalog/test-results
event-catalog/tests
event-catalog/templates
event-catalog/openapi
event-catalog/.dev-logs
event-catalog/src/admin/node_modules
event-catalog/src/admin/dist

# --- never, anywhere ---------------------------------------------------------
**/.git
**/.github
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.tsbuildinfo
